ass ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="is commonly used in pastries">is commonly used in pastries</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="desserts">desserts</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="and soy milk">and soy milk</span>. 또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame is often pressed into oil for cooking or direct consumption">black sesame is often pressed into oil for cooking or direct consumption</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="White sesame">White sesame</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="with its lighter color and distinct nutty flavor">with its lighter color and distinct nutty flavor</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="is widely used in baking pastries and sauces">is widely used in baking pastries and sauces</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="Based on my knowledge">Based on my knowledge</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="I think white sesame is perfect for sprinkling on food to enhance both flavor and texture">I think white sesame is perfect for sprinkling on food to enhance both flavor and texture</span>.</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="Common black sesame products">Common black sesame products</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="Black sesame paste is perhaps one of the most well-known foods">Black sesame paste is perhaps one of the most well-known foods</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="Due to its rich nutrition">Due to its rich nutrition</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="when roasted and finely ground into powder">when roasted and finely ground into powder</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="it aids in bowel movements">it aids in bowel movements</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="nourishes the liver">nourishes the liver</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="and benefits the kidneys">and benefits the kidneys</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Other products include black sesame balls and black sesame cookies">Other products include black sesame balls and black sesame cookies</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="Common white sesame products">Common white sesame products</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="White sesame">White sesame</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="due to its unique flavor">due to its unique flavor</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="is often processed into sesame oil and sesame paste">is often processed into sesame oil and sesame paste</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="The well-known “two-eight sauce” is a mixture of sesame paste and peanut butter in a">The well-known “two-eight sauce” is a mixture of sesame paste and peanut butter in a</span> 2:8 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="ratio">ratio</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="where the sesame paste is made from white sesame">where the sesame paste is made from white sesame</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="White sesame paste differs from black sesame paste in color">White sesame paste differs from black sesame paste in color</span>, 맛, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="and aroma">and aroma</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="making it better suited for mixing with peanut butter to achieve the unique rich flavor and smooth texture of two-eight sauce">making it better suited for mixing with peanut butter to achieve the unique rich flavor and smooth texture of two-eight sauce</span>. 그러므로, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="I believe white sesame is an indispensable condiment">I believe white sesame is an indispensable condiment</span>.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_What_are_the_main_differences_between_black_sesame_and_white_sesame"></span><strong>4. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="What are the main differences between black sesame and white sesame">What are the main differences between black sesame and white sesame</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul><li><strong>색상</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="Black sesame is dark black or dark brown">Black sesame is dark black or dark brown</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="while white sesame is pale yellow or white">while white sesame is pale yellow or white</span>.</li><li><strong>영양성분</strong>: 둘다 단백질이 풍부해서, 지방, 비타민, 그리고 미네랄, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="but black sesame contains higher amounts of certain nutrients">but black sesame contains higher amounts of certain nutrients</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="such as insoluble dietary fiber">such as insoluble dietary fiber</span>, 칼슘, 그리고 비타민 E. 또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame is rich in anthocyanins">black sesame is rich in anthocyanins</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="a natural pigment with strong antioxidant properties">a natural pigment with strong antioxidant properties</span>.</li><li><strong>용도</strong>: 검은깨, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="with its unique color and strong aroma">with its unique color and strong aroma</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="is commonly used in pastries">is commonly used in pastries</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="sweets">sweets</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="beverages">beverages</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="and health foods like black sesame paste and black sesame oil">and health foods like black sesame paste and black sesame oil</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="White sesame">White sesame</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="on the other hand">on the other hand</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="is more often used as a condiment or cooking ingredient">is more often used as a condiment or cooking ingredient</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="such as in sesame paste or sesame oil">such as in sesame paste or sesame oil</span>.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_What_are_the_commonalities_between_black_sesame_and_white_sesame"></span><strong>5. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="What are the commonalities between black sesame and white sesame">What are the commonalities between black sesame and white sesame</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul><li><strong>영양이 풍부한</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="Both are high in protein">Both are high in protein</span>, 지방, 비타민 (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="such as vitamin E">such as vitamin E</span>), 그리고 미네랄 (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="like calcium">like calcium</span>, 마그네슘, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="and iron">and iron</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="which are essential for human health">which are essential for human health</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="Antioxidants">Antioxidants</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="Both contain antioxidant substances">Both contain antioxidan