rs">and black sesame cookies are popular among consumers</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_134" data-source="" data-orig="while sesame oil is an essential cooking seasoning">while sesame oil is an essential cooking seasoning</span>. 또한, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_135" data-source="" data-orig="they can be used in making noodles and fillings">they can be used in making noodles and fillings</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_136" data-source="" data-orig="providing more variety on the dining table">providing more variety on the dining table</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_137" data-source="" data-orig="Whether it&#8217;s for breakfast">Whether it&#8217;s for breakfast</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_138" data-source="" data-orig="lunch">lunch</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_139" data-source="" data-orig="or dinner">or dinner</span>, 검은 참깨, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_140" data-source="" data-orig="with its unique nutritional value and delicious taste">with its unique nutritional value and delicious taste</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_141" data-source="" data-orig="has become an important part of people&#8217;s diets">has become an important part of people&#8217;s diets</span>.</p><p><img src="/images/Black-Sesame-vs.-White-Sesame-2-300x226.jpg" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-428" alt="Black Sesame vs. White Sesame" width="623" height="469" title="검은 참깨 vs 흰 참깨cts 차이점과 용도에 대한 사실" /></p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Other_Questions_About_Black_and_White_Sesame"></span><strong>6. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_142" data-source="" data-orig="Other Questions About Black and White Sesame">Other Questions About Black and White Sesame</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_143" data-source="" data-orig="Can they substitute each other as ingredients">Can they substitute each other as ingredients</span>?</strong> 어떤 경우에는, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_144" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame and